  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Training System of the Bureau of manpower employment and training with upgrading of three TTCs</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Skills Employment and Investment Program financed by the Ministry of Finance with the support from Asian Development Bank and SDC will assist the upgrading of 3 TTCs through project implementation. KOICA will support the improvement of the training system of BMET and also provide technical assistance in upgrading the TTCs.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall goal of the project is to produce competent human resources through skilling the manpower through development of training system of BMET for the local and international labour market.&#xc9c1;&#xc5c5;&#xd6c8;&#xb828;&#xc6d0; &#xae30;&#xc220;&#xad50;&#xc0ac; &#xad50;&#xc721;&#xc744; &#xd1b5;&#xd55c; &#xae30;&#xc220;&#xad50;&#xc721;&#xc758; &#xc9c8; &#xd5a5;&#xc0c1;</narrative>
  </description>
